{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"撒迦利亚书","commonName":"撒迦利亚书","title":"撒迦利亚书","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"8cf62f43a8ce797cc4cdd63e937097d1b0225901663353bd7ce9b6f60df7db51","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["飞行的书卷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又举目观看，见有书卷在飞。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["天使问我：“你看见什么？”我说：“我看见一本飞行的书卷，长九米，宽四米半。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他说：“这是临到全天下的咒诅，因为书卷一面写着‘凡偷盗的必被清除’，另一面写着‘凡起假誓的必被清除’。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["万军之耶和华说：“我要使这咒诅进入盗贼和奉我的名起假誓者的家，留在他们家里，直到毁灭一切，不留一木一石。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["量器中的女子"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["与我说话的天使又来对我说：“你举目观看，看看出现了什么？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我问道：“这是什么？”他说：“这是一个量器。”接着他又说：“里面盛着天下人的罪。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["只见量器的铅盖打开了，里面坐着一个女子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["天使说：“这是罪恶。”他把女子推回量器中，盖上铅盖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我又举目观看，见有两个女子展翅飞来，她们的翅膀像鹳鸟的翅膀。她们把量器提到空中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我问与我说话的天使：“她们要把量器带到哪里？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他说：“要带到示拿",{"noteId":1},"，在那里为它建造房屋，建好后就把它安置在底座上。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"“示拿”巴比伦的别名。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ZEC/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}